# Preserve working Parc features

Never remove, hide or disconnect a working control, setting, shortcut, behavior
or its tests to match another browser. Replay onboarding in Settings → General
is protected. Preserve additions when changing layout; surface any genuine
product conflict to the user. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
